  _source: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 452abb290e07527479cb82a8890c04ec, type: 3}
  _lines:
  - Speaker: Laurice
    Text: Do you think this is Claudius' work Julian?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Laurice
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: -3154334995067897491, guid: ffa9ecac345bc29489d842a6a35acfa3,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Perhaps, but it would be best to keep that to ourselves...
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Laurice
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: -3154334995067897491, guid: ffa9ecac345bc29489d842a6a35acfa3,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: eb776ccddca018d4e9951a87c124e825,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: A wary heart would only make others more wary and we have not the strength
      to match them yet...
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Laurice
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: -3154334995067897491, guid: ffa9ecac345bc29489d842a6a35acfa3,
